The visits is an empty list of text.
Place "9001 discuss.leetcode.com" into visits.
Keep a shared domain as empty text.
Keep a shared amount as 0.
Keep a shared names as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared totals as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared suffix as empty text.
Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared counttext as empty text.
To seek from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of names, return.
If item spot of names matches suffix, set found to spot, return.
Seek from spot plus 1.

To gather from start (a whole number).
The finish is the last position of domain.
Set finish to finish plus 1.
Set suffix to the slice of domain from start to finish.
Set found to -1.
Seek from 0.
If found is at least 0, The slot is found, Set item slot of totals to item slot of totals plus amount.
If found is less than 0, The copy is a copy of suffix, Place copy into names, Place amount into totals.

To close.
Gather from 0.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of domain.
If spot is more than 0 and character spot of domain is ".", gather from spot plus 1.

To walk from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of counttext, close, return.
The digit is the digit value of character spot of counttext.
Set amount to amount times 10 plus digit.
Walk from spot plus 1.

For each entry in visits.
The parts is split entry by " ".
Set counttext to empty text.
Place item 0 of parts into counttext.
Set domain to empty text.
Place item 1 of parts into domain.
Set amount to 0.
Walk from 0.

For every spot from 0 to the last position of names.
The line is format whole number item spot of totals as text.
Place " " into line.
Place item spot of names into line.
The shown is a copy of line.
Show shown.
